; `end` closes an apply block only when followed by nothing, by `apply`
; (optionally with the block's keyword), or by an apply keyword alone, as
; in the older `end tag`.  Any other word used to close the newest block
; silently; it is now an error.

apply account Personal

2024/01/01 Test
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    Assets:Cash

end bogus

test reg -> 1
__ERROR__
While parsing file "$FILE", line 12:
Error: Unrecognized directive 'end bogus'
end test
